{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_4000_situation", "source_sha256": "6e7e6a003a94fd1289b8d04ef1d8fe8a5f3d9e0ac14e061e64f6aa70e24fcae4", "ja": "CMのイメージ会議　直前", "zh": "广告代言会议　开始前", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_4000_place", "source_sha256": "af806d6b5d7b486258106fe92bbe6ec9b2b41e7882d322962bac27e2ec1ae954", "ja": "道すがら歩道", "zh": "步道途中", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_4001_p", "source_sha256": "3c39d5eb6fde3021a4370f119d532e7555f21910a4fe6148ce51f74e406cd3eb", "ja": "（紗代子が、学習塾のイメージキャラクターに\n選ばれた。これから、そのCMの打ち合わせだ）", "zh": "（纱代子被选为补习班的代言人了。\n接下来要开会讨论这支广告。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_4002_027say", "source_sha256": "fc79130a237ed6a1d585009628b78167a19ac53f00bdadf2b6945579ef1d3461", "ja": "{$P$}！　今日の会議のテーマは、\n受験生が入塾したくなるようなCM、ですよね。", "zh": "{$P$}！今天的会议主题是\n拍出让考生想报名的广告，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_4003_027say", "source_sha256": "0b1acc23153498d4cfdceccbe3e25b1d8ddc2fdf9735fd3162a57dbfabc2a878", "ja": "私も学生ですから、生徒の気持ちになって\n考えてみたんですけど……。", "zh": "我也是个学生，\n所以试着以学生的角度思考了一下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_4004_027say", "source_sha256": "5c4bec5cb6892cd7e39c53acbc507d1593d3ba2a05e62764672ab2ae4d139969", "ja": "受験生を励まして、勇気づけるような。\nそんなCMがいいと思うんです！", "zh": "我觉得可以鼓励考生，\n给他们勇气的广告比较好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_4005_p", "source_sha256": "b134204ca792626114a110eb866343199209e4afa9cb1f79d2ebcbdcf090763d", "ja": "確かにそうだな……。\n紗代子、もしかして何か考えてきたのか？", "zh": "的确是这样……\n纱代子，你难道有什么想法吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_4006_027say", "source_sha256": "cab721e60cc3d11b2647a26e98513a70376d27c1ae30ffb7f2de7b6e8773e091", "ja": "はい！　私なりにですけど、キャッチフレーズを……。\n{$P$}は、どれがいいと思いますか？", "zh": "是的！我自己思考了宣传词……\n{$P$}觉得哪个比较好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_4007", "source_sha256": "6792a937f79f7e4a1544c7df5387956a9f36e45a68f82551d0b708d84e77dcf8", "ja": "私と一緒に、\n最高の春を迎えよう！", "zh": "和我一起\n迎接最棒的春天吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_4008", "source_sha256": "5f3bdcc16f60be236507c48cf04ab2e3b056d176c0ae9f13096a0d56ef431a55", "ja": "とにかく\n私についてきて！", "zh": "总之\n跟着我来吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_4009", "source_sha256": "29ca9102dcfa584dfe1802d2176ad02372b5e4d6fa1e67e04ba06fc48ccd8210", "ja": "紗代子のスパルタ教室\n開講！", "zh": "纱代子的斯巴达教室\n开始讲习！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_4100_p", "source_sha256": "ae95a945c788ee4e3c818dc2c6d656ff7b0d2e621f57a9631a1a704b3692d5f9", "ja": "『私と一緒に、最高の春を迎えよう！』か……\nうん、これがいいんじゃないかな！", "zh": "『和我一起迎接最棒的春天吧！』……\n嗯，这个感觉很不错！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_4101_027say", "source_sha256": "11d48b2e76c04d79e2a58eb5d28c6fa4aef3269e615fe51b840a9bedf1e6764e", "ja": "やっぱり、{$P$}も\nそう思いますか？", "zh": "果然{$P$}\n也这么想吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_4102_027say", "source_sha256": "b08c6b615dab4e47c86257f98b20bf865f60b4e74d069c0bc901c9a266fa2371", "ja": "不安でいっぱいの受験生には、寄りそうような言葉が\n響くと思うので……このフレーズ、提案してみます！", "zh": "我觉得能够体贴考生忐忑不安的心理，会比较\n容易得到共鸣……我会试着提议这个广告词看看的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_4200_p", "source_sha256": "02350ea053efdff7633b6f553a7fc93bf2ceef25041ad4d144b60edbbe72a4de", "ja": "『とにかく私についてきて！』ってのが、\n紗代子のパワーを感じられていいと思う。", "zh": "我觉得『总之跟着我来吧！！』这句\n能感受到纱代子的力量，很不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_4201_027say", "source_sha256": "bf4396601eba207457adacfd9c61a4c1e4784ab5e2cc2f2c676a230fa973d483", "ja": "私のパワー、ですか？　なるほど……。", "zh": "我的力量吗？原来如此……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_4202_027say", "source_sha256": "8ed2de2f6f850cc3b86b7256da3b4f5a3f3b5dd44a446d355431f618f9dee7ab", "ja": "確かに、誰かを引っ張っていったり支えたりするのは、\n私向きですね。今日は、これを提案してみます。", "zh": "的确，去拉人一把、支持别人很适合我呢。\n我今天会提议这个广告词试试看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_4300_p", "source_sha256": "01ab225a8b98d1eb842155afc0983fad6ccdf79a0fc00f521a08f1571ef31ae4", "ja": "『紗代子のスパルタ教室、開講！』だな。\nイメージに、ピッタリだぞ！", "zh": "『纱代子的斯巴达教室，开始讲习！』这个吧。\n很符合你的形象喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_4301_p", "source_sha256": "6e7ff4078cc70a18fcbd83a6130b49a32c782cf4b77a3e47224e603aced721f7", "ja": "紗代子が教壇に立って、ビシビシ鍛えてくれる様子が\n目に浮かぶようだ。", "zh": "都能想像到纱代子站在讲台上\n严厉教课的样子了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_4302_027say", "source_sha256": "ea17a6f337a49f6055198ea029780beea7a9fe2c26bfeacc0f222fbd169a2084", "ja": "……{$P$}。\n私は先生じゃなくて、アイドルですからね？", "zh": "……{$P$}。\n我不是老师，是偶像才对喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_4303_p", "source_sha256": "359d13e94c602daf69a1ba623dc6a88996d7ce7359052d987c184d253029f330", "ja": "わ、わかってるよ。\nただ、似合うなって……。", "zh": "我、我知道啊。\n只是觉得很适合你……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_4304_027say", "source_sha256": "4f41cc5564e89ee0e7611186591a99cdd9a7239f0fe1d0b3daca751ed72c8b17", "ja": "もう……真面目に考えてください！\nこの案は無しで行きますっ。", "zh": "真是的……麻烦你认真思考！\n这个提案就取消吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
